# Reproducible evaluation definitions and reviewed baselines are source artifacts.
# Raw runs, preflight outputs, and provider transcripts remain ignored by default.
!plans/evidence/**/README.md
!plans/evidence/**/contract*.json
!plans/evidence/**/result.schema.json
!plans/evidence/**/run-*-ab.mjs
!plans/evidence/**/runtime-context-fixture.mjs
!plans/evidence/**/runtime-performance-gate.mjs
